      "message": "Merge Dependabot PRs with an app token so push workflows fire\n\nSame fix as romaine-life/my-homepage#84: merges made with the default\nGITHUB_TOKEN don't fire push workflows, so Dependabot auto-merges left\ndeploy/apply workflows untriggered. Mint an infra-bootstrap-github-app\ninstallation token (org Dependabot secret AUTOMERGE_APP_PRIVATE_KEY)\nand merge with that instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
